Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:39.21,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正标雅宋_GBK\fad(312,314)\fs25\fsp1.5\an8\bord1.2\c&H010101&\3c&HFBF9FC&\b1\pos(640,664)}公館女主人 卡珊德拉夫人
